  {
    "id": "hero",
    "nome": "Hero",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<header><section class=\"w-full bg-white\" aria-label=\"Hero\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"container max-w-lg px-4 py-24 mx-auto text-left md:max-w-none md:text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-left text-gray-900 md:text-center sm:leading-none md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\"><span class=\"inline md:block\">Edilizia</span><span class=\"relative mt-2 text-transparent md:inline-block bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-600 to-indigo-500\" style=\"font-size:0.75em\">su fune.</span></h1><p class=\"mx-auto mt-5 text-gray-500 md:mt-12 md:max-w-lg md:text-center lg:text-lg\">Interventi in quota senza ponteggi: grondaie, facciate, tetti e messa in sicurezza, con tecnici certificati che raggiungono ogni punto dell'edificio in meno di 60 minuti.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center mt-6 text-center\"><span class=\"relative inline-flex w-full md:w-auto\" style=\"gap:12px\"><a href=\"#servizi\" aria-label=\"Guarda i servizi\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-white bg-indigo-600 border border-transparent rounded-full md:w-auto hover:bg-indigo-500\">Guarda i servizi</a><a href=\"#pricing\" aria-label=\"Richiedi preventivo\" onclick=\"trackClick('edilextreme','preventivo-hero','Preventivo',0)\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-indigo-600 bg-white border border-indigo-600 rounded-full md:w-auto hover:bg-indigo-50\">Preventivo gratuito</a></span></div></div></div></section></header>"
  },
  {
    "id": "whatis",
    "nome": "Perché lavorare su fune",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<section class=\"px-2 py-32 bg-gray-100 md:px-0\" id=\"whatis\" aria-labelledby=\"whatis-title\">\n  <div class=\"container items-center max-w-6xl px-8 mx-auto xl:px-5\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center sm:-mx-3\">\n      <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 md:px-3\">\n        <div class=\"w-full pb-6 space-y-6 sm:max-w-md lg:max-w-lg md:space-y-4 lg:space-y-8 xl:space-y-9 sm:pr-5 lg:pr-0 md:pb-0\">\n          <h2 id=\"whatis-title\" class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl\">\n            <span class=\"block xl:inline\">Perché</span>\n            <span class=\"block text-indigo-600 xl:inline\">lavorare su fune?</span>\n          </h2>\n          <p class=\"mx-auto text-base text-gray-500 sm:max-w-md lg:text-xl md:max-w-3xl\">\n            Le tecniche di accesso su corda, mutuate dall'alpinismo industriale, permettono di intervenire su qualsiasi edificio senza le settimane di attesa e i costi di un ponteggio tradizionale.\n          </p>\n          <ul class=\"p-0 m-0 leading-6 border-0 border-gray-300\" aria-label=\"Vantaggi principali\">\n            <li class=\"box-border relative py-1 pl-0 text-left text-gray-500 border-solid\">\n              <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-white bg-yellow-300 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold\">✓</span></span> Zero ponteggi, zero impalcature\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"box-border relative py-1 pl-0 text-left text-gray-500 border-solid\">\n              <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-white bg-yellow-300 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold\">✓</span></span> Fino al 40% in meno rispetto al ponteggio\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"box-border relative py-1 pl-0 text-left text-gray-500 border-solid\">\n              <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-white bg-yellow-300 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold\">✓</span></span> Tecnici certificati, interventi rapidi\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2\">\n        <figure class=\"w-full h-auto overflow-hidden rounded-md shadow-xl sm:rounded-xl bg-gray-800 p-4\" aria-label=\"Tecnico su fune al lavoro\" style=\"min-height:280px\">\n          <div style=\"background:#1e2130;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\">\n            <div style=\"background:#151824;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;gap:6px\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <span style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff5f57;display:inline-block\"></span>\n              <span style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#febc2e;display:inline-block\"></span>\n              <span style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#28c840;display:inline-block\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;height:240px\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <div style=\"width:130px;background:#1a1d2e;padding:12px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\">\n                <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#a89fff;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(108,99,255,.25)\">🧗 Servizi</div>\n                <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);padding:6px 8px\">🏗️ Cantieri</div>\n                <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);padding:6px 8px\">🛡️ Sicurezza</div>\n                <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);padding:6px 8px\">📋 Preventivi</div>\n                <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);padding:6px 8px\">📞 Contatti</div>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"flex:1;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n                <div style=\"height:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:3px;width:55%\"></div>\n                <div style=\"height:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:3px\"></div>\n                <div style=\"height:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:3px;width:40%\"></div>\n                <div style=\"flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border-radius:5px\"></div>\n                <div style=\"height:24px;background:rgba(108,99,255,.5);border-radius:5px;width:90px\"></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  },
  {
    "id": "stack",
    "nome": "Sei motivi per fidarsi",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<section class=\"w-full bg-white pt-7 pb-7 md:pt-20 md:pb-24\" id=\"stack\" aria-labelledby=\"stack-title\">\n  <div class=\"box-border flex flex-col items-center content-center px-8 mx-auto leading-6 text-black border-0 border-gray-300 md:flex-row max-w-7xl lg:px-16\">\n    <div class=\"box-border w-full text-black border-solid md:w-1/2 md:pl-6 xl:pl-32\">\n      <h2 id=\"stack-title\" class=\"m-0 text-xl font-semibold leading-tight border-0 lg:text-3xl md:text-2xl\">Sei motivi per fidarsi</h2>\n      <p class=\"pt-4 pb-8 m-0 leading-7 text-gray-700 border-0 sm:pr-10 lg:text-lg\">\n        Tecnici certificati, prezzi trasparenti, interventi rapidi: tutto quello che serve per lavorare in sicurezza in quota.\n      </p>\n      <ul class=\"p-0 m-0 leading-6 border-0 border-gray-300\" aria-label=\"Motivi per scegliere EdilExtreme\">\n        <li class=\"box-border relative py-1 pl-0 text-left text-gray-500 border-solid\">\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-white bg-yellow-300 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold\">✓</span></span> Totale sicurezza, tecnici certificati\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"box-border relative py-1 pl-0 text-left text-gray-500 border-solid\">\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-white bg-yellow-300 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold\">✓</span></span> Accesso senza limiti, ogni punto dell'edificio\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"box-border relative py-1 pl-0 text-left text-gray-500 border-solid\">\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-white bg-yellow-300 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold\">✓</span></span> Zero ponteggi, meno burocrazia\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"box-border relative w-full max-w-md px-4 mt-10 mb-4 text-center bg-no-repeat bg-contain border-solid md:mt-0 md:max-w-none lg:mb-0 md:w-1/2\">\n      <div class=\"bg-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 text-left\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Punti di forza\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\" role=\"listitem\"><p class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 text-sm\">Prezzi trasparenti</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1\">Nessun costo nascosto</p></div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\" role=\"listitem\"><p class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 text-sm\">Interventi rapidi</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1\">Stesso giorno</p></div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\" role=\"listitem\"><p class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 text-sm\">Zero ponteggi</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1\">Meno di un'ora</p></div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\" role=\"listitem\"><p class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 text-sm\">Assistenza continua</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1\">Dal preventivo alla consegna</p></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  },
  {
    "id": "features",
    "nome": "Servizi",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<section class=\"py-20 bg-gray-50\" id=\"features\" aria-labelledby=\"features-title\">\n  <div class=\"container max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8\">\n    <h2 id=\"features-title\" class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-center\">Servizi</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-2 text-lg text-center text-gray-600\">Dodici interventi, un solo metodo: accesso su corda, nessun ponteggio.</p>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-8 mt-10 sm:grid-cols-8 lg:grid-cols-12 sm:px-8 xl:px-0\" role=\"list\">\n      <article class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center justify-between col-span-4 px-8 py-12 space-y-4 bg-white shadow-sm sm:rounded-xl\" role=\"listitem\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 text-white bg-indigo-500 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-gray-700\">Impermeabilizzazione</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-center text-gray-500\">Terrazzi, tetti e lastre protetti dall'acqua e dagli agenti atmosferici.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-between col-span-4 px-8 py-12 space-y-4 bg-white shadow-sm sm:rounded-xl\" role=\"listitem\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 text-white bg-indigo-500 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-gray-700\">Grondaie e pluviali</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-center text-gray-500\">Pulizia, manutenzione e sostituzione di ogni componente.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-between col-span-4 px-8 py-12 space-y-4 bg-white shadow-sm sm:rounded-xl\" role=\"listitem\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 text-white bg-indigo-500 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-gray-700\">Pulizia vetri in altezza</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-center text-gray-500\">Vetrate di palazzi e grattacieli, anche nei casi più complessi.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-between col-span-4 px-8 py-12 space-y-4 bg-white shadow-sm sm:rounded-xl\" role=\"listitem\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 text-white bg-indigo-500 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-gray-700\">Messa in sicurezza</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-center text-gray-500\">Rimozione urgente di materiale pericolante su fune.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-between col-span-4 px-8 py-12 space-y-4 bg-white shadow-sm sm:rounded-xl\" role=\"listitem\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 text-white bg-indigo-500 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-gray-700\">Pannelli fotovoltaici</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-center text-gray-500\">Pulizia per mantenere l'efficienza dell'impianto.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-between col-span-4 px-8 py-12 space-y-4 bg-white shadow-sm sm:rounded-xl\" role=\"listitem\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 text-white bg-indigo-500 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-gray-700\">Balconi e facciate</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-center text-gray-500\">Ristrutturazione e ripristino estetico e strutturale.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  },
  {
    "id": "pricing",
    "nome": "Preventivo",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<section class=\"py-20 bg-white\" id=\"pricing\" aria-labelledby=\"pricing-title\">\n  <div class=\"container max-w-5xl mx-auto px-8\">\n    <h2 id=\"pricing-title\" class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-center text-gray-900\">Preventivo gratuito, sopralluogo incluso.</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-center text-gray-500 mb-12\">Rispondiamo entro 24 ore, festivi esclusi.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 justify-center items-stretch\" role=\"list\">\n\n      <article class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 max-w-sm p-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200\" role=\"listitem\" aria-label=\"Intervento singolo\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-gray-400 uppercase\">Intervento singolo</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-end gap-1 mt-4\">\n          <span class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900\">Preventivo</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-500 text-sm\">Ideale per un singolo intervento puntuale: grondaie, vetri, tinteggiatura.</p>\n        <ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-3 flex-1\" aria-label=\"Cosa include\">\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><span class=\"text-green-500 font-bold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> Sopralluogo gratuito</li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><span class=\"text-green-500 font-bold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> Tecnici certificati</li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><span class=\"text-green-500 font-bold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> Intervento stesso giorno</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Richiedi preventivo intervento singolo\" onclick=\"trackClick('edilextreme','preventivo-singolo','Intervento singolo',0)\" class=\"mt-8 inline-flex justify-center items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-indigo-600 text-indigo-600 font-bold hover:bg-indigo-50\">Richiedi preventivo</a>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 max-w-sm p-8 bg-indigo-600 rounded-2xl text-white shadow-xl\" role=\"listitem\" aria-label=\"Manutenzione periodica — consigliato\">\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase opacity-80\">Manutenzione</p>\n          <span class=\"text-xs bg-yellow-400 text-gray-900 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Consigliato</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-end gap-1 mt-4\">\n          <span class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold\">Preventivo</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 opacity-80 text-sm\">Controlli periodici programmati su tetti, grondaie e facciate.</p>\n        <ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-3 flex-1\" aria-label=\"Cosa include\">\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-yellow-300 font-bold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> Tutto l'intervento singolo</li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-yellow-300 font-bold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> Interventi programmati</li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-yellow-300 font-bold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> Priorità sugli interventi urgenti</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Richiedi preventivo manutenzione\" onclick=\"trackClick('edilextreme','preventivo-manutenzione','Manutenzione',0)\" class=\"mt-8 inline-flex justify-center items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white text-indigo-600 font-bold hover:bg-indigo-50\">Richiedi preventivo</a>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  },
  {
    "id": "cta",
    "nome": "CTA finale",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<section class=\"py-20 bg-gray-900 text-white text-center\" aria-labelledby=\"cta-title\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto px-8\">\n    <h2 id=\"cta-title\" class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4\">Pronto a iniziare?</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg mb-8\">Compila il modulo o scrivici su WhatsApp: rispondiamo entro 24 ore.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\">\n      <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Richiedi preventivo\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-white bg-indigo-500 rounded-full hover:bg-indigo-400\">\n        Richiedi preventivo\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Scrivici su WhatsApp\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500 rounded-full hover:bg-indigo-900\">\n        Scrivici su WhatsApp\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  }
]
